POSIX: the POSIX functions (process, user and group IDs, terminals,
...).

The module posix of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/posix.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its
headers in include/php82/php/ext/posix.
